{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/11/9853792/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白子とかあん肝とか\n蟹味噌とかちょっと苦味のあるものが\n大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで1番美味しかった食べ物は\nのぎ天釣り部で食べた、\nイカ飯と\nお醤油に肝を溶かしてそこに漬けて食べた\nイカのお刺身です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうにかもう一度食べたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服どーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/11/9853792/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろ側はモーニングみたいになってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制作は順調に進んでおります( ^ω^ )\nアンダー曲今回も踊り甲斐のある\n激しさがありますよ( ^ω^ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く披露したいなあ～～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/11/9853792/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃん中学校のサッカー部時代の写真を上げる...とかいって上がってないような笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→たぶんモバメで送った気がするよ～！\nたぶん...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃんは自分でお菓子作りとかしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→料理よりお菓子作りのがするよ～！\nあげる人がいない(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)\nメンバー貰ってくれるかな...？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎今年の順位戦もいよいよ大詰め、羽生名人への挑戦権はだれが獲得するか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→A級はもちろんだけど他の級？も\n気になるよ～～(;_;)！\n太地先生昇級できるといいな><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問が足りなくなってきたので\nお待ちしております～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《告知》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- TV --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋フォーカス   NHK Eテレ\n毎週日曜 10:00～\n(再)毎週木曜 15:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂工事中 テレビ東京系\n2月14日(日) 24:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタイン企画後半戦！\n前半に引き続き波乱の展開と\nなるのでしょうか...？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ラーメンWalkerTV2 フジテレビONE\n2月25日(木)12:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/11/9853792/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープンしたばかりの\n81番さんにお邪魔しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かの有名な、パインラーメンのお店の\n店主さんのお店です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"町田駅にあるんだけど\n町田は中高の頃しょっちゅう来てた街だから\n久しぶりに上陸できて楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- 雑誌/新聞 --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋世界 3月号 発売中\n◎フレッシュヤンヤン 2016 SPRING 発売中\n◎BOMB 3月号 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/